---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure & Legal | AirbrushDOC"
  description="Affiliate disclosure, print-on-demand terms, cookie policy, and privacy information for AirbrushDOC.com."
>
  <main class="abd-container" style="max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 80px;">
    <nav style="font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--abd-text-muted); margin-bottom:32px;">
      <a href="/" style="color:var(--abd-text-dim); text-decoration:none;">Home</a>
      <span style="margin:0 8px;">›</span>
      <span>Affiliate Disclosure</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 style="font-family:var(--abd-font-display);font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);font-weight:800;color:var(--abd-text);margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">
      Affiliate Disclosure &amp; Legal
    </h1>
    <p style="color:var(--abd-text-dim);font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:48px;">Last updated: April 2026</p>

    <div class="disc-content">

      <section class="disc-section">
        <h2>Amazon Associates Disclosure</h2>
        <p>AirbrushDOC.com is a participant in the <strong>Amazon Services LLC Associates Program</strong>, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and affiliated Amazon marketplaces (including amazon.co.uk, amazon.de, amazon.fr, amazon.it, amazon.es, and others).</p>
        <p>When you click on a product link on this site and make a purchase on Amazon, I may earn a small commission at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>. The price you pay is exactly the same whether or not you use my affiliate link.</p>
        <p>I only recommend products I genuinely believe are worth your money. My reviews and recommendations are based on personal use, research, and community feedback — not commission rates. Affiliate relationships do not influence my editorial opinions.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="disc-section">
        <h2>Other Affiliate &amp; Partner Programs</h2>
        <p>In addition to Amazon, AirbrushDOC may participate in other affiliate programs and partnerships. These include but are not limited to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Manufacturer direct affiliate programs (airbrush brands, paint brands)</li>
          <li>European retail affiliate networks</li>
          <li>Digital product platforms</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Wherever affiliate links are present in an article, I aim to clearly mark them or note the relationship at the top of the post. Links marked <code>/go/...</code> are affiliate short-links. You are never obligated to use these links.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="disc-section">
        <h2>Print-on-Demand &amp; Merchandise (Printify)</h2>
        <p>AirbrushDOC may offer branded merchandise (prints, apparel, accessories) fulfilled through <strong>Printify</strong>, a print-on-demand platform. By placing an order for merchandise, you agree to the following terms:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Fulfillment:</strong> Orders are manufactured and shipped by Printify's network of third-party print providers. AirbrushDOC does not hold physical inventory.</li>
          <li><strong>Production time:</strong> Items are made-to-order. Production typically takes 2–7 business days before shipping begins.</li>
          <li><strong>Shipping:</strong> Shipping times vary by print provider and destination. Estimated delivery times are shown at checkout but are not guaranteed.</li>
          <li><strong>Returns &amp; refunds:</strong> Because items are made to order, I do not accept returns for buyer's remorse. If your item arrives damaged, defective, or with a print error, contact me within 30 days of delivery with photos and I will arrange a replacement or refund.</li>
          <li><strong>Sizing:</strong> Please check the size chart carefully before ordering. I cannot exchange items for sizing errors.</li>
          <li><strong>International orders:</strong> Customs duties and import taxes may apply and are the buyer's responsibility.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>For merchandise enquiries, contact me at <a href="mailto:info@airbrushdoc.com">info@airbrushdoc.com</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="disc-section">
        <h2>FTC Compliance</h2>
        <p>In accordance with the <strong>U.S. Federal Trade Commission (FTC) guidelines</strong> on endorsements and testimonials, I disclose all material connections between AirbrushDOC and any brand, product, or service mentioned on this site. This includes affiliate relationships, sponsored content, free products received for review, and paid partnerships.</p>
        <p>When a product was provided free of charge for review, this will be noted in the relevant article. Free products do not guarantee positive reviews — I maintain full editorial independence.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="disc-section" id="cookies">
        <h2>Cookies, Tracking &amp; Privacy</h2>
        <p>How this site handles your data — newsletter, contact form, comments, cookies, third-party embeds, retention, and your GDPR rights — is covered in full in the dedicated <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        <p>The short version: no analytics platform runs on this site, affiliate platforms set their own cookies when you click their links, and I do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="disc-section">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about any of the above? Reach me at <a href="mailto:info@airbrushdoc.com">info@airbrushdoc.com</a> or via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.disc-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
.disc-section {
  padding: 32px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--abd-border);
}
.disc-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.disc-section h2 {
  font-family: var(--abd-font-display);
  font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--abd-text); margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.disc-section p {
  font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--abd-text-dim);
  line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.disc-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.disc-section ul {
  margin: 12px 0 12px 0; padding-left: 0; list-style: none;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
}
.disc-section ul li {
  font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--abd-text-dim);
  line-height: 1.65; padding-left: 20px; position: relative;
}
.disc-section ul li::before {
  content: '→'; position: absolute; left: 0;
  color: var(--abd-orange); font-size: 0.8rem;
}
.disc-section a { color: var(--abd-orange); text-decoration: none; }
.disc-section a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.disc-section code {
  font-size: 0.85em; background: var(--abd-surface2);
  border: 1px solid var(--abd-border); border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 1px 6px; color: var(--abd-text);
}
</style>
